<title>SWITZERLAND: Adecco details pro forma, GAAP results.</title>
<headline>Adecco details pro forma, GAAP results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PERIOD to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net before goodwill  241		 vs 206</p>
<p> Net per share (Sfrs)	 14.46	     vs 12.36</p>
<p> Div (bearer, Sfrs)	   5.00		vs n/a</p>
<p> Revenues			 8,524	     vs 7,609</p>
<p> Operating income	     388		 vs 356</p>
<p> Total assets		   4,877.6	   vs 1,890.0</p>
<p> Net debt			 82.2		vs n/a</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity	 2,402.1	   vs n/a</p>
<p> Taxes			    129.0	     vs 111.5</p>
<p> Number of shares	     16,663,672	vs 16,663,672</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Adecco SA. Company was formed via merger of Swiss concern Adia and French concern Ecco in 1996. The unaudited pro forma data show Adecco's consolidated results as if the merger had happened at the start of 1995 and excludes sales of businesses in 1996 and 1995. It also excludes merger-related costs, one-time gains from disposals of investments and amortisation expenses.</p>
<p>(U.S. GAAP)</p>
<p>Group net after goodwill &amp;</p>
<p> restructuring costs	 -11.1		vs 129.6</p>
<p> Operating profit	     271.3	     vs 195.1</p>
<p> Revenues			 6,386	     vs 4,161</p>
<p> Gross margin		   1,151.3	   vs 668.0</p>
<p> Goodwill amortisation	191.8	     vs 2.8</p>
<p> Merger-related costs	 21.3		vs n/a</p>
<p> Gain on sales of assets    54.9		vs 10.9</p>
<p> Interest,taxes,minorities  128.1	     vs 87.6</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
